// Instant self-centered burst, cantrip tier (scaled well down from
// hemomancy/gory_eruption.ron's level-3 numbers). Force damage: `Explosion`'s
// damage is hardcoded to `DamageKind::Crushing` (common/src/states/
// explosion.rs), not RON-configurable -- ships as Crushing regardless of the
// sheet's Force flavor, the same pre-existing gap gory_eruption.ron/
// hemoclysm.ron (also flavor-mismatched: Hemomancy blood damage, also
// Crushing) already ship with.
Explosion(
    energy_cost: 0,
    buildup_duration: 0.4,
    action_duration: 0.2,
    recover_duration: 0.3,
    damage: 10,
    poise: 5,
    knockback: (direction: Away, strength: 5.0),
    radius: 3,
    min_falloff: 0.4,
    dodgeable: Roll,
    destroy_terrain: None,
    eye_height: false,
    reagent: None,
    meta: (school: Some(Conjuration), source: Some(Arcane)),
)
